    japanese: "\u4F4D\u7F6E\u60C5\u5831\u306E\u8A31\u53EF\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - key: GPS_ERR_PERMISSION_DENIED_FOREVER
    english: Location is denied. Set GOLFIN's location to "While Using the App" in
